* SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
* battclock.resource (NDK battclock_lib.fd), in the C900 dialect of
* exec_lib.fd.  Each function takes BattClockBase as its first argument.
* WriteBattClock and ResetBattClock return a status (0, BCERR_NOCLOCK or
* BCERR_RANGE) where Amiga's return nothing.
##base _BattClockBase
##bias 6
##public
ResetBattClock()() int
ReadBattClock()() ULONG
WriteBattClock(time)(ULONG) int
##end
